{"id":"32ddf86ddf0d947d","group":"72","path":"72/72-ex-cyclic-term-equation.md","title":"循环方程没有有限项统一子","display":"ex-cyclic-term-equation — 循环方程没有有限项统一子","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-ex-cyclic-term-equation","aliases":["72-ex-cyclic-term-equation"],"display":"ex-cyclic-term-equation — 循环方程没有有限项统一子","depends_on":["[[72-thm-finite-term-occurs-check]]"],"chapter":"IX","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IX §2.5; local minimal finite-term counterexample","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-ex-cyclic-term-equation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-ex-cyclic-term-equation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-cyclic-term-equation — 循环方程没有有限项统一子"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0c13b53e3c2977f7\" href=\"?note=0c13b53e3c2977f7\" title=\"72-thm-finite-term-occurs-check\">72-thm-finite-term-occurs-check</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IX"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX §2.5; local minimal finite-term counterexample"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in F\">\\(f\\in F\\)</span> 的元数为1，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span>；签名其余部分满足本册逻辑程序条件。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma:\\operatorname{Unif}(\\{\\langle x,f(x)\\rangle\\},\\theta)\\}=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma:\\operatorname{Unif}(\\{\\langle x,f(x)\\rangle\\},\\theta)\\}=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>x是f(x)的真子项，故出现检查直接给空统一子集。把x映成f(x)只会使左边成为f(x)、右边成为f(f(x))，不是该方程的解。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-thm-finite-term-occurs-check","status":"resolved","id":"0c13b53e3c2977f7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-finite-term-occurs-check]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"f\\in F","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma:\\operatorname{Unif}(\\{\\langle x,f(x)\\rangle\\},\\theta)\\}=\\varnothing.","display":true}],"bytes":1132,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-82","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增6项：[[72-df-logic-program-term-size]] · [[72-ex-cyclic-term-equation]] · [[72-ex-mgu-not-unique-as-substitution]] · [[72-ex-sld-success-with-infinite-branch]] · [[72-lem-mgu-mutual-factorization]] · [[72-thm-finite-term-occurs-check]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-78","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增6项：[[72-df-logic-program-term-size]] · [[72-ex-cyclic-term-equation]] · [[72-ex-mgu-not-unique-as-substitution]] · [[72-ex-sld-success-with-inf